title Rename One Session - Target, Header Migration Pending
participant "HTTP configuration" as API
participant "Name command" as Command
participant "Naming rules" as Rules
database "Session repository" as Repo
alt HTTP configuration update
  API -> Rules : Normalize submitted name
  Rules --> API : Validated name
  API -> Repo : Lock latest Session, merge fields and commit
  Repo --> API : Authoritative Session from committed snapshot
else Slash name command
  Command -> Rules : Normalize command argument
  Rules --> Command : Validated name
  Command -> Repo : Rename under current Session lock
  Repo --> Command : Authoritative Session for NameResult
end
note over API,Repo
  Invalid names return before mutation.
  Both paths validate the latest locked Session.
  Later committed writes to the same field win.
end note
