title Finish One Manual Compaction - Target, Runtime Path Implemented
participant "HTTP request" as Http
participant "Compaction admission" as Service
participant "Accepted execution" as Execution
database "Session history" as History
Http -> Service : Request manual compaction
Service -> Service : Lock operation; recheck idle
alt Empty history
  Service --> Http : compacted=false; no execution or history write
else Compactable request
  Service -> Execution : Start with retained lease and credentials
  Http -> Execution : Observe non-cancelling terminal handle
  Execution -> History : Persist compaction if context changed
  Execution --> Http : JSON terminal result
  Execution -> Execution : Finish cleanup; release retained resources
end
note over Http,Execution
  Disconnect does not cancel accepted compaction.
  Terminal delivery and final cleanup are distinct boundaries.
end note
